# One job per line:  <name>|<prerequisite (path that must exist) or ->|<arguments for python>
# Run from the repository root:  source scripts/env.sh && bash experiments/run_jobs.sh experiments/05_core_size.jobs

# Core size: 10%, 5% and 50% of the unit groups per task instead of 25% (the 25% runs are in 01 and 03).
# Only the final test evaluation is run (--eval-every 100000); evaluations never change training.
# Seed 0's two-task runs were pilots ending on validation scenes (02_ablations.jobs); they are re-evaluated on test scenes.

